#: ../../extending/index.rst:97
msgid "Embedding the CPython runtime in a larger application"
msgstr "在更大的应用程序中嵌入 CPython 运行时"

#: ../../extending/index.rst:99
msgid ""
"Sometimes, rather than creating an extension that runs inside the Python "
"interpreter as the main application, it is desirable to instead embed the "
"CPython runtime inside a larger application. This section covers some of the "
"details involved in doing that successfully."
msgstr ""
"有时，不是要创建在 Python 解释器中作为主应用程序运行的扩展，而是希望将 "
"CPython 运行时嵌入到更大的应用程序中。 本节介绍了成功完成此操作所涉及的一些细"
"节。"

